A yarn berry lock holding two left-pad releases, a scoped package and workspace
entries, and under classic/ a yarn v1 lock, which is not understood.

-- package.json --
{
  "name": "fixture",
  "dependencies": {
    "left-pad": "^1.3.0",
    "@scope/util": "^2.0.0",
    "sibling": "workspace:^"
  }
}
-- yarn.lock --
